{"script":"s_2_9_0","des":"（怎么了，小朋友？）","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]你们好！我是顺风米莉！两位就是解决了异变的英雄吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘻嘻，英雄什么的，哪有啦～[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]能解决困扰村子这么久的异变，你们肯定就是英雄！那、那米莉，有一份契约想要拜托英雄！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"你也懂契约？","tag":"tag_8"},{"text":"想拜托我们什么呢？","tag":"tag_8"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[cm][show]嗯……米莉想要给希瑟老师准备一个礼物！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]前天希瑟老师讲课的时候，提到了[color=ffb64d]鲜花[colorEnd]这个词！大家当时就问老师，[color=ffb64d]鲜花[colorEnd]是什么样的呀，和赤剑草有什么不同呀？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]可是老师说……她没有办法告诉我们。因为索利德山很少有鲜花可摘……她以前住的地方到处都有，漫山遍野都是鲜花……！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]虽然老师没有明说，但米莉能感觉到老师很不开心！就因为这儿没有鲜花！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"索利德山确实很少见到鲜花……","tag":"tag_13"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[cm][show]所以，米莉想在山上找一朵[color=ffb64d]鲜花[colorEnd]来送给老师！米莉希望你们能在路上保护米莉，这就是米莉提出的契约！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]如果米莉一个人跑出村子，大人们肯定会担心的。可是如果有英雄保护米莉，大人就肯定放心了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]原来如此……是想要给老师送花啊。不过如果你需要鲜花的话，我们可以下山帮你买哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]不行——！花一定要是米莉亲手在索利德山里摘下来的，这样才能证明索利德山也有鲜花，老师才不会不高兴！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉？是、是这样吗……想要亲手摘的……这片光秃秃的山里，真的能找到鲜花吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]这个……米莉只听过传闻，但从来没有见到过。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这个传闻又是什么？","tag":"tag_20"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[cm][show]对了！去问埃达叔叔吧！他肯定知道怎么在山上找到鲜花！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]埃达？那位皮匠是吗……不过你怎么知道他肯定知道？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]嘻嘻……等一下你们就知道了。走吧走吧，咱们这就去找他！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}